    "text_full": "Skip to Content\n\nPagePlay\n\nGuides\nWhat is a CMS?\nLogging in\nLogging out\nWorking with pages\nWorking with paragraphs\nWorking with photos\nAdd downloadable files\nWorking with your Photobanner\nSite statistics (via Google Analytics)\nYour PagePlay email\nAdding new email accounts\nEmail account limit\nSetting up your email account\nAccess your email using webmail\nSet up email in Mail for Mac\nSet up email on iPhone or iPad\nSet up email on iPad\nSet up email on Android\nSet up email in Outlook 2010\nSet up email in Outlook Express\nSet up email in Windows Live Mail\nSet up email in Windows Live Mail 2012\nSet up email in Mozilla Thunderbird\nSet up email in Gmail\nSet up email in Yahoo Mail\nArchiving your old emails\nReset an email account password\nSet an out of office message\nBuy a new domain\nShould you drop the www?\nAdding more users who can edit content\nSupported browsers\nUpdate your mail servers\nSearch engines\nSearch Engine Optimisation tips\nGoogle Search console Verification\nFacebook Like Box / Button\nOpening links in new tabs/windows\nReferrer terms and conditions\nSetting up your email account\n\nThe details required for connecting your email app / client are always the same, but the screens or language used often depends on the app you’re using. Apps are updated often and these guides will not always keep up with those changes. Here are the bits you’ll always need:\n\nIncoming / IMAP / Receiving:\n\nServer: mail.pageplay.com\nUsername: Your full email address\nPassword: Your email password\nPort: 993\nConnection type: SSL or TLS or SSL/TLS\n\nIf you don't have an SSL or TLS or SSL/TLS option try STARTTLS and port 143.\n\nOutgoing / SMTP / Sending:\n\nServer: mail.pageplay.com\nUsername: Your full email address\nPassword: Your email password\nPort: 465\nSecure connection? Yes\nConnection type: SSL or TLS or SSL/TLS\n\nIf you don't have an SSL or TLS or SSL/TLS option try STARTTLS and port 587.\n\nGuides for some popular email clients:\n\nAccess your email using webmail\n\nSet up email in Mail for Mac\n\nSet up email on iPhone\n\nSet up email on iPad\n\nSet up email on Android\n\nSet up email in Outlook 2010\n\nSet up email in Outlook Express\n\nSet up email in Windows Live Mail\n\nSet up email in Windows Live Mail 2012\n\nSet up email in Mozilla Thunderbird\n\nSet up email in Gmail\n\nSet up email in Yahoo Mail\n\nhelp@pageplay.com\n\n© PagePlay Limited, 2026 - Simple Content Management by PagePlay\n\nCookie policy"
